        </summary>
        <nav class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-x-6">
              <a href="#top-picks" class="flex items-baseline gap-3 py-2.5 border-t border-gray-100 text-[15px] text-gray-700 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline"><span class="w-6 shrink-0 text-gray-400 font-semibold">1.</span><span>Top Picks</span></a>
              <a href="#ac-ratings" class="flex items-baseline gap-3 py-2.5 border-t border-gray-100 text-[15px] text-gray-700 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline"><span class="w-6 shrink-0 text-gray-400 font-semibold">2.</span><span>Abrasion Ratings Explained</span></a>
              <a href="#thickness" class="flex items-baseline gap-3 py-2.5 border-t border-gray-100 text-[15px] text-gray-700 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline"><span class="w-6 shrink-0 text-gray-400 font-semibold">3.</span><span>Thickness and Core</span></a>
              <a href="#water-claims" class="flex items-baseline gap-3 py-2.5 border-t border-gray-100 text-[15px] text-gray-700 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline"><span class="w-6 shrink-0 text-gray-400 font-semibold">4.</span><span>Spill and Water Claims</span></a>
              <a href="#rooms" class="flex items-baseline gap-3 py-2.5 border-t border-gray-100 text-[15px] text-gray-700 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline"><span class="w-6 shrink-0 text-gray-400 font-semibold">5.</span><span>Where Laminate Belongs</span></a>
